From 3a653b9f37b299809ab1fce388b21c63e48025c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bernd Kuhls <bernd@kuhls.net>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:29:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] avformat/hls: disable extension_picky check

Fixes tvheadend streaming of hls streams:

libav: AVFormatContext: URL https://<some_url> is not in allowed_
 segment_extensions, consider updating hls.c and submitting a patch to
 ffmpeg-devel, if this should be added
iptv: libav: Could not open input 'https://<some_url.m3u8': Invalid data
 found when processing input

Signed-off-by: Bernd Kuhls <bernd@kuhls.net>
---
 libavformat/hls.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavformat/hls.c b/libavformat/hls.c
index 91bc7fa650..ce7eb8fefe 100644
--- a/libavformat/hls.c
+++ b/libavformat/hls.c
@@ -958,6 +958,8 @@ static int test_segment(AVFormatContext *s, const AVInputFormat *in_fmt, struct
     int matchA = 3;
     int matchF = 0;
 
+    return 0;
+
     if (!c->extension_picky)
         return 0;
 
-- 
2.47.3

